{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>And returned</b> Three times in the Masorah: here, and the other: \"went out, gone out, and returned, until the waters dried up\" (Ezekiel 47:5), and: \"the living creatures ran and returned\" (Ezekiel 1:14). This is what they said: from the sweat of the living creatures the river of fire emerges — just as \"and returned\" here deals with a river, so too there."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:48.343694715Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}